      "writtenOn": "2021-03-23T15:59:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I could not find a use of classpaths_config in the topic how is this used? How does this differ from classpaths_system_config?\n\nThis looks as though it could be replaced by the boot_image module once I have got that into a better state.",
      "revId": "655bf3559da02a2f15ff748d4bb665a5cd8bfa9d",
