        "id": 1061164
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-23T16:07:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://r.android.com/1650263 for an example.\n\nclasspaths_config converts existing .json file into proto.\n\nsystem_config generates it based on dexpreopt_config logic. Although it could be replaced by classpaths_config, I am worried partner impact is too big for now? So, if we start small, we don\u0027t have to modify how make propagates boot jars for example. All of the \"cleanup\" is a separate project I\u0027d say.",
      "parentUuid": "6f4fc35b_d928e985",
      "revId": "655bf3559da02a2f15ff748d4bb665a5cd8bfa9d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
