        "id": 1060959
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T09:45:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "to me, this CL seems more complicated than just adding a genrule_defaults that modules can reuse to convert a textproto into proto. Do we need to customize the build system for this?",
      "parentUuid": "a7f003e9_1a565496",
      "revId": "655bf3559da02a2f15ff748d4bb665a5cd8bfa9d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7e6632df_dcc2648a",
        "filename": "java/dexpreopt_config.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 186,
