      "message": "Happy to change eventually! All I really care about is that /apex/foo/etc/classpath contains classpaths.proto message at runtime. :-)\n\nShould we still go with this approach in the meantime? Note that in follow up I would be introducing classpaths.json for most of the apexes.",
